"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids has come in under 90% of normal in January to February in 38 of 75 years since 1951, the most of any pair. In 2025, the middle of the grids saw March to April at 242% of normal and September to October at 43%. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 71% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 17832 shows a preliminary August to September 2026 estimate of 21.9, and RMA&rsquo;s final index can differ.</p>"}
